# Mailer Lists Module

> Centralized repository of mineral owner mailing records used to generate acquisition campaigns and track owner outreach.

---

# Overview

The Mailer Lists module stores and manages owner contact records prepared for direct mail campaigns. It serves as the operational bridge between prospect research and active acquisition efforts.

Each Mailer Record represents a potential acquisition opportunity tied to an owner, property, lease, and campaign.

The module tracks mailing status, responses, returned mail, and conversion into active Deals.

---

# Objectives

The Mailer Lists module enables users to:

- Maintain owner mailing records
- Organize mailing campaigns
- Track delivery status
- Record owner responses
- Identify returned mail
- Convert qualified owners into Deals
- Measure campaign effectiveness

