---

## Status Definitions

### Not Sent

Owner is queued for a future mailing.

---

### Sent

Letter has been mailed.

---

### Delivered

Mail delivery has been confirmed.

---

### Responded

Owner has contacted the company regarding the offer.

This may trigger Deal creation.

---

### Returned (RTS)

Mail returned to sender.

Requires address verification.

---

### Dead

Owner is no longer eligible for future campaigns.

Examples:

- Duplicate owner
- Deceased
- Invalid address
- Requested removal

