# Business Rules

## Rule 1

One owner may have multiple Mailer Records.

---

## Rule 2

A Mailer Record cannot belong to more than one active campaign simultaneously.

---

## Rule 3

Responded records are eligible for Deal creation.

---

## Rule 4

Returned Mail automatically creates an Address Verification task.

---

## Rule 5

Dead records are excluded from future campaign exports.

